      "story_id": 1,
      "headline": "Kast unveils 40-measure 'National Reconstruction' economic package in first nationwide address, sparking fierce political debate",
      "summary": "President Kast delivered Chile's first national broadcast address of his term on April 15, presenting the 'Plan de Reconstrucci\u00f3n Nacional y Desarrollo Econ\u00f3mico y Social'\u2014a package of more than 40 measures anchored by a corporate tax cut from 27% to 23%, a formal employment subsidy, regulatory streamlining, housing VAT relief, and investment certainty statutes. The plan drew immediate support from governing coalition partners Chile Vamos and Partido Republicano, sharp opposition criticism that it favors the ultra-wealthy, internal cabinet tensions (the gratuity university limit was dropped after minister disagreements), and fact-checking scrutiny of presidential claims.",
